          "item": {
            "@type": "NewsArticle",
            "headline": "Anthropic's Claude gets expanded compute capacity via SpaceX Colossus data centre deal",
            "articleSection": "Daily Utility",
            "abstract": "Anthropic's Claude AI has secured access to compute capacity from SpaceX's Colossus data centre facility, a move that has allowed Anthropic to relax previously tight usage limits on its models. The arrangement means Claude users will encounter fewer rate limits and capacity constraints, improving day-to-day reliability for enterprise and consumer users. The deal underscores how AI labs are increasingly turning to non-traditional infrastructure partners to meet surging compute demand.",
            "url": "https://www.theregister.com/ai-and-ml/2026/05/06/claude-hitches-a-ride-on-spacexs-datacenter-capacity/5231252",
            "publisher": {
